ad.<\/li>  <li>Dise\u00f1o elegante con puerta FullWhite y detalles metalizados.<\/li>  <li>Tecnolog\u00eda 3DWave con un sistema de ondas m\u00e1s eficiente que envuelve al 100 % los alimentos.<\/li>  <li>700W de potencia repartidos en 6 niveles.<\/li>  <li>Grill de 800 W con resistencias hal\u00f3genas m\u00e1s eficientes.<\/li>  <li>Modo de descongelaci\u00f3n que se adapta a todos los alimentos.<\/li>  <li>Controles manuales giratorios.<\/li>  <li>Temporizador hasta 30 minutos.<\/li>  <li>Avisador ac\u00fastico de final de cocci\u00f3n.<\/li>  <li>Medidas: <\/li>  <li>Externa: 44 x 34.7 x 25.5 cm<\/li>  <li>Interna: 27.8 x 29.2 x 17.4 cm<\/li>  <li>Di\u00e1metro del plato: 24.3 cm<\/li>  <li><b>Composici\u00f3n<\/b><\/li>  <li>Microondas.<\/li>  <li>Plato giratorio.<\/li>  <li>Parrilla de metal.<\/li>  <li>Manual de instrucciones.<\/li><\/ul><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"CECOTEC","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0,"unit_price":53.06,"unit_price_tax":53.06,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Cocina","sub_category":"Microondas - Hornos","quantity":0,"brand":"CECOTEC","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_cec-pae-mic%20proclean%203120%20wh_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":48.06}}},"8435484042598":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["8435484042598",false],"wholesale_price":[21.65,false],"price":[26.65,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 1.5",false],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":true,"